(I_A\otimes P_B)\ket{S_A(\rho')} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{K}}\sum_{i,j=1}^N\ket{\conjugate{g_j}} \ket{b_i}\braket{b_i}{g_j} \left(\sum_{m=1}^{\min\{\lceil Kg_j\rceil, \frac{K}{\delta} 2^{c'}b_i\}}\ket{m, m} \right).
\end{equation*}
Therefore,
